0          "This 2da contains a list of feats that should"  ****      **** ****           ****   
1          "be present in each base class's cls_feat_*.2da" ****      **** ****           ****   
2          "These are non-class specific feats requiring"   ****      **** ****           ****   
3          "a radial entry."                                ****      **** ****           ****   
4          ****                                             ****      **** ****           ****   
5          "Please keep this file updated, as it is used"   ****      **** ****           ****   
6          "to keep the actual cls_feat_*.2das updated."    ****      **** ****           ****   
7          "To propagate changes to this file, run the"     ****      **** ****           ****   
8          update_all_base_classes_feats.bat                ****      **** ****           ****   
9          ****                                             ****      **** ****           ****   
10         "If there are feats that require class-specific" ****      **** ****           ****   
11         "differences from the values presented here,"    ****      **** ****           ****   
12         "add an entry to the cls_feat_*.2da for that"    ****      **** ****           ****   
13         "class in the area outside the BEGIN or END"     ****      **** ****           ****   
14         "markers. The batch file will then skip adding"  ****      **** ****           ****   
15         "a duplicate of that feat during updates."       ****      **** ****           ****   
